    {
      "date": "1977-01-26",
      "kind": "permit appeal",
      "description": "The Board of Permit Appeals overruled the Department of Public Works' denial of a permit to alter the building at 402 Font Boulevard, with the intent that the structures in question should properly be classified as an I Occupancy rather than as apartment buildings.",
