      "date": "1977-03-30",
      "kind": "permit appeal",
      "description": "The Board of Permit Appeals upheld the Department of Public Works' denial of a permit to alter the building at 402 Font Boulevard on rehearing, the appeal being denied for lack of the required four overrule votes.",
